# This pipeline will attempt to run basically everything we got against everything we discover.
# Probably overkill but what the hell. Many of these pipelines won't even be hit.

# Recon tools.
untangle
wafw00f
testssl
subfinder | untangle
subfinder | wafw00f
subfinder | testssl
dig | subfinder | untangle
dig | subfinder | wafw00f
dig | subfinder | testssl
nmap-full | testssl
dig | nmap-full | testssl
subfinder | dig | nmap-full | testssl
dig | subfinder | dig | nmap-full | testssl

# Attack tools.
nikto
subfinder | nikto
dig | subfinder | nikto
hydra
nmap-full | hydra
dig | nmap-full | hydra
subfinder | dig | nmap-full | hydra
dig | subfinder | dig | nmap-full | hydra
